            rationale: "The lab now needs rough-transport cart designs developed with a method another lab published. Adopting or running that method requires a role holding method.develop, and the existing Lab lead holds that scope and is chartered to evaluate reusable methods. The existing active Lab lead's charter (evaluate reusable methods) and method.develop scope already cover this work, so assigning the requirement to it gives a single accountable owner with no new role, scope or budget. No capability request is made: the evidence reference is not a public URL, so no observed source can be given, and the retained method selection is evidence, not an installed capability. Distinct continuing work that would justify a specialist role has not been shown.",
